## Optional escalation — the Companion (live surfaces)
Only if the prospect wants more than the record. Start the Companion from the deployment
page; its live-asset links open three routes — **/** the analyst copilot (the room asks
its own filing question and watches the trace land next to the seeded history),
**/dossier** the rendered validation memo, and **/workbench** the branded governance
layer on the same APIs (spec designer, evaluator injection, runs, coverage, promote,
sign-off). The workbench is flagged **alpha** — preview it before you show it.

**Live certification, no shell:** /workbench → **designer** → compose the spec (release ×
suites × evaluators × gates, `{{ candidate_a_model }}` as the release under test) →
**Save spec →**, then **Run this experiment →** on the spec page. The run makes real
model calls on the deployment's shared LLM key (capped) — tick one small slice on stage,
not the full {{ suite_info["items"] }} items. The run page carries the verdict, sign-off
and the evidence pack.

