## Break-glass
- No model access at the venue? Nothing in the walk above needs one — all five rows read
  the seeded record, and seeding made zero model calls. Only the live copilot and the
  optional workbench run touch a model; drop both and the story is intact.
- Every anchor above was asserted by the deploy's `verify` gate, which is fatal — the
  deployment only reached green because each one landed.

## Reset
Teardown is project-level and depot-native: **deploy again** against a fresh Langfuse
project. Do not re-seed the same one — OTLP appends rather than upserting, so the demo
would be told twice; `import-spool` refuses a second run rather than doubling it.

