## Developer mode — not a presenter beat

Everything below runs this kit from a shell, outside the depot. **No step in the walk
above needs it**: in a depot deployment the pipeline already ran these for you, and a
presenter has no shell.

```
synth plan       --config config/demo.yaml   # volumes + billable estimate (the confirm gate)
synth seed       --config config/demo.yaml   # deterministic backdated ingest
synth evaluators --config config/demo.yaml   # populate the project's Evaluators page
synth verify     --config config/demo.yaml   # assert every anchor in this runbook
synth probe      --config config/demo.yaml   # validate backdated ingestion on a new host
synth memo       --config config/demo.yaml   # render CERT_MEMO.md
synth script     --config config/demo.yaml   # re-render this runbook, DEMO_MAP, walkthrough
```

Headless certification — the same pipeline the workbench designer drives:

```
synth certify --config config/demo.yaml --model {{ candidate_a_model }} --gate
synth certify --config config/demo.yaml --offline   # suite self-consistency, no model calls
```

`synth playground --config config/demo.yaml` serves the Companion locally (the depot
starts it for you). On the Cloud free tier use `--config config/cloud-demo.yaml` and check
current event caps first (see that file's header).
